Final goal:

Create a smart mining search system that behaves like an intelligent miner:

- Scan once.
- Remember useful targets.
- Reuse valid information.
- Update only when necessary.
- Avoid scanning the same chunks repeatedly.
- Maintain all existing mining and navigation features.